==Fame==
Fame is a cosmetic system that is unlocked after a player unlocks every Brawler, shown on the right side of the Brawler selection screen. Each Fame rank has three levels that require a certain number of points to reach. Every Credit gets converted to one point. Fame is shown in the player's profile and their battle card in the battle start screen. After reaching a certain level, exclusive [[Battle Cards]], [[Profile Icons]], and [[Pins]] are unlocked.
